I, contains fragment)|400|`invalid_target`|The value does not satisfy RFC 8707 §2 URI requirements.| |`resource` on `/token` does not match `resource` on `/au\n\nWhen you rely on a result in your answer, cite it inline as a markdown link, e.g. [title](url)."}
